2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:05,220
So whose idea was it to put everybody in the diner on skates?
那麼讓餐廳裡的每個人都穿上溜冰鞋是誰的主意呢？

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:08,740
Some idiot customer put a suggestion in the suggestion box.
一些白痴顧客在意見箱裡提出了建議。

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,560
Oh my god, they took my idea!
天哪，他們採納了我的想法！

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:11,080
That was you?
那是你嗎？

6
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:11,380
Yeah!
是的！

7
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:13,880
Okay, there you go.
好的，就這樣吧。

8
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:15,380
Rachel?
雷切爾？

9
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:16,780
I made you a call call.
我打了電話給你。

10
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,160
Oh my god, it's so fast!
天啊，這速度也太快了吧！

11
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:22,260
Oh my god, are you guys okay?
天哪，你們還好嗎？

12
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:22,540
You alright?
你還好吧？

13
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,060
Oh my.
天哪。

14
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:39,500
So no one told you life was going to be this way
所以沒有人告訴你生活會是這樣

15
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:44,940
Your job's a joke, you're broke, your love life's the only way
你的工作就是個笑話，你破產了，你的愛情生活是唯一的出路

16
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:49,020
It's like you're always stuck in second gear
就像你總是卡在二檔

17
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:54,200
When it hasn't been your day, week, month, even year
當這不是你的一天、一週、一月、甚至一年的時候

18
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:58,160
But I'll be there for you
但我會在你身邊

19
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,220
When you're ready as possible
當你儘可能準備好時

20
00:01:00,220 --> 00:01:03,560
I'll be there for you
我會在你身邊

21
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,480
Like I've been there before
就像我以前去過那裡一樣

22
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:08,660
I'll be there for you
我會在你身邊

23
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:10,760
Because you're there for me too
因為你也在我身邊

24
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,880
Hey. Hey.
嘿。嘿。

25
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:23,240
You know, with that goatee, you kinda look like Satan.
你知道，留著山羊鬍子，你看起來有點像撒旦。

26
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:28,760
Oh, so that's why the priest threw holy water on me.
噢，原來神父把聖水灑在我身上的原因。

27
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:34,000
Okay, listen, you have to cheer up, okay?
好吧，聽著，你必須振作起來，好嗎？

28
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:36,080
You should come out with Ross and me.
你應該和羅斯和我一起出去。

29
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,140
I mean, anything is better than sitting around here crying all day about Kate.
我的意思是，任何事情都比整天坐在這裡為凱特哭泣要好。

30
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,240
Hey, I was crying because...
嘿，我哭是因為……

31
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:44,840
because nobody believed Quincy's theory, okay?
因為沒人相信昆西的理論，好嗎？

32
00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:46,760
Hi. Hi.
你好。你好。

33
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:49,020
I'm gonna be on TV. No way!
我要上電視了決不！

34
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:52,600
Yeah, they're putting together this panel to talk about these fossils
是的，他們正在組成這個小組來討論這些化石

35
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:55,440
they just found in Peru, and the Discovery Channel's gonna film it.
他們剛剛在秘魯發現了，探索頻道將拍攝它。

36
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:56,820
Oh, my God!
我的天啊！

37
00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:58,960
Who's gonna watch that?
誰會看那個？

38
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,100
Thanks. You ready to go? Yeah.
謝謝。你準備好了嗎？是的。

39
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:04,400
Saw a girl with that vest.
看到一個穿著那件背心的女孩。

40
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:05,360
Thanks.
謝謝。

41
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:12,740
While most of us think of chocolate bunnies and baskets as traditional Easter gifts,
雖然我們大多數人認為巧克力兔子和籃子是傳統的復活節禮物，

42
00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:15,880
some people insist on giving live chicks as presents.
有些人堅持送活雞當禮物。

43
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,160
Unfortunately, the sad fact remains
不幸的是，悲傷的事實仍然存在

44
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:22,380
that most of these little guys won't live to see the 4th of July
大多數小傢伙都活不到 7 月 4 日

45
00:02:22,380 --> 00:02:25,260
because as a result of improper care, they will be dead.
因為如果護理不當，它們就會死亡。

46
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,160
Yeah, hi, you guys got any of those baby chicks?
是的，嗨，你們有那些小雞嗎？

47
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:32,460
Because I was watching this commercial on TV, and, man, those things are cute.
因為我在電視上看這個廣告，而且，天哪，那些東西很可愛。

48
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,240
Hi. Hi.
你好。你好。

49
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:39,660
Oh, Pete, you're back. Hey, check this out.
哦，皮特，你回來了。嘿，看看這個。

50
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:42,180
Wow, skates.
哇，溜冰鞋。

51
00:02:42,860 --> 00:02:48,000
Wow, you're a lot sturdier than Chandler.
哇，你比錢德勒堅強多了。

52
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,560
You grumbled like a piece of paper.
你像一張紙一樣抱怨。

53
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:51,800
So, how was your trip?
那麼，你的旅行怎麼樣呢？

54
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,780
Oh, what'd you bring me?
噢，你為我帶來了什麼？

55
00:02:55,980 --> 00:02:58,100
Oh, hotel toiletries from Japan.
哦，日本的飯店盥洗用品。

56
00:02:58,440 --> 00:03:01,160
Oh, these are gonna go in my permanent collection.
哦，這些將成為我的永久收藏。

57
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,280
You know what that says in English?
你知道那句話用英文怎麼說嗎？

58
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:04,660
Made in Texas.
德克薩斯州製造。

59
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:08,380
Want some coffee? Yeah, sure, that'd be great.
想喝點咖啡嗎？是的，當然，那就太好了。

60
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,440
Regular or decaf?
普通的還是脫咖啡因的？

61
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,580
Whichever's closest.
以最接近的為準。

62
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:18,920
So, ask me what I did today.
那麼，問我今天做了什麼。

63
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:20,680
So, what did you do today, Pete?
那麼，皮特，你今天做了什麼？

64
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,440
I bought a restaurant, and I would like you to be the head chef.
我買了一家餐館，我想請你當主廚。

65
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:24,240
What? Oh!
什麼？哦！

66
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:32,060
Can you believe he just offered me a restaurant?
你能相信他剛剛給我提供了一家餐廳嗎？

67
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,680
What a jerk. Want me to kick his ass?
真是個混蛋。想要我踢他的屁股嗎？

68
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:38,040
I mean, this has been, like, my dream
我的意思是，這就像我的夢想

69
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:41,260
since I got my first Easy-Bake oven and opened Easy Monica's Bakery.
自從我有了第一個 Easy-Bake 烤箱並開了 Easy Monica's Bakery 以來。

70
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:51,380
I mean, I would kill for this job.
我的意思是，為了這份工作我願意殺人。

71
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:52,940
I mean, I can totally do this job,
我的意思是，我完全可以勝任這份工作

72
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:55,120
and God knows I've paid my dues.
上帝知道我已經付出了代價。

73
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,240
Pete's just doing this because he has a crush on me.
皮特這樣做只是因為他迷戀我。

74
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:02,500
And you're still not attracted to him at all?
而你還是對他一點吸引力都沒有？

75
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:03,760
No.
不。

76
00:04:05,060 --> 00:04:06,800
I mean, how can I accept a restaurant from him?
我的意思是，我怎麼能接受他開的餐廳呢？

77
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:07,880
I can't.
我不能。

78
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:10,900
I couldn't even accept a necklace from Stu Vincent in the seventh grade.
我甚至無法接受七年級時斯圖文森特送的項鍊。

79
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,980
Yeah, but, Mon, that was totally different.
是的，但是，蒙，那是完全不同的。

80
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,260
He was your health teacher.
他是你的健康老師。

81
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:15,940
Ow!
噢！

82
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,340
What, honey?
什麼，親愛的？

83
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:21,320
Oh, my side still hurts from when you crashed into me yesterday.
哦，昨天你撞到我時，我的身邊還很痛。

84
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,540
Oh, God, I'm so sorry.
哦，上帝，我很抱歉。

85
00:04:23,860 --> 00:04:26,580
Hey, you guys, guess what?
嘿，你們猜怎麼著？

86
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:33,040
Got a job on a riverboat?
在河船上找到工作嗎？

87
00:04:35,660 --> 00:04:38,940
You know what? I didn't wear this suit for a year because you hated it.
你知道嗎？我已經一年沒穿這套衣服了，因為你討厭它。

88
00:04:39,020 --> 00:04:41,220
Well, guess what? You're not my girlfriend anymore, so...
嗯，你猜怎麼著？你不再是我的女朋友了，所以...

89
00:04:41,220 --> 00:04:43,340
Oh, I see. So this suit is making a point.
我懂了。所以這套衣服很有意義。

90
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:46,980
Now that you're on your own, you're free to look as stupid as you'd like.
現在你可以獨自一人了，你可以隨心所欲地表現得愚蠢。

91
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:49,740
You like it, right?
你喜歡它，對吧？

92
00:04:49,900 --> 00:04:50,580
Oh, absolutely.
哦，絕對是。

93
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:53,360
I like it even more on you than I did on Colonel Sanders.
我比桑德斯上校更喜歡你。

94
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:55,820
Oh, Ross! Ross, I'm kidding!
哦，羅斯！羅斯，我開玩笑的！

95
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:57,680
Yeah, I'm here. What were you gonna tell us?
是的，我在這裡。你要告訴我們什麼？

96
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:59,860
Yeah, oh, was it how you invented the cotton chandelier?
是啊，哦，這就是你發明棉質枝形吊燈的方法嗎？

97
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:00,260
Okay, goodbye.
好的，再見。

98
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,640
With that little heart?
就憑那顆小小的心嗎？

99
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:05,760
Oh, come on, are you kidding?
哦，來吧，你在開玩笑嗎？

100
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:08,800
Don't you remember when you were kids and you used to wear that gray sweatsuit
你不記得小時候你常穿那件灰色運動服嗎

101
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,220
and they used to call you the Hindenburg?
他們以前叫你興登堡？

102
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:11,940
No?
不？

103
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,440
My mistake.
我的錯誤。

104
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:20,220
So, um, after you put the suggestion in the box,
所以，嗯，當你將建議放入框中後，

105
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:22,700
how long did it take for the roller-skating thing to happen?
輪滑的事情發生花了多久時間？

106
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:24,800
Um, about three months.
嗯，三個月左右。

107
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:29,660
Okay, so I guess that's about, uh, two weeks before the topless thing kicks in.
好吧，所以我想大約是，呃，兩週前，裸體的事情開始了。

108
00:05:31,820 --> 00:05:32,080
Hey!
嘿！

109
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:33,140
Hey!
嘿！

110
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:36,040
I gotta tell you something.
我得告訴你一件事。

111
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:37,820
Open that book!
開啟那本書！

112
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,320
Okay.
好的。

113
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,940
It's a chicken.
這是一隻雞。

114
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:49,880
It's cute, huh?
很可愛吧？

115
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:52,620
Whoa, whoa, whoa, you guys, do you know anything about chicks?
哇，哇，哇，你們這些傢伙，你們瞭解小妞嗎？

116
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:53,640
Fowl?
雞？

117
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:54,300
No.
不。

118
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:55,840
Women?
女性？

119
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,360
No.
不。

120
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:01,220
Okay, well, they are a huge responsibility.
好吧，他們肩負著巨大的責任。

121
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:04,300
Especially at this age, they require constant care.
尤其是在這個年齡段，他們需要不斷的照顧。

122
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:07,520
They need just the right food and lots and lots of love.
他們需要合適的食物和很多很多的愛。

123
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,200
Oh, well, no problem.
哦，好吧，沒問題。

124
00:06:15,980 --> 00:06:16,800
Easy, Lenny.
簡單點，萊尼。

125
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:23,860
So, I mean, have you thought about it?
那麼，我的意思是，你有考慮過嗎？

126
00:06:25,020 --> 00:06:26,220
Okay, here's the thing.
好吧，事情就是這樣。

127
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,420
Oh, no, not the thing. I hate the thing.
哦，不，不是這個問題。我討厭這件事。

128
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:30,460
What's the thing?
怎麼了？

129
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:33,280
I can't do it.
我做不到。

130
00:06:33,900 --> 00:06:36,660
I'm sorry. Oh, I wish I could, but, um,
對不起。哦，我希望我可以，但是，嗯，

131
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:38,980
see, you have these feelings for me.
看，你對我有這些感覺。

132
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:41,560
Wait, wait, wait, wait, that's what you're worried about?
等等，等等，等等，這就是你所擔心的？

133
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,280
Well, if that's the problem, we've got no problem.
好吧，如果這就是問題所在，那我們就沒有問題了。

134
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:44,160
Huh?
啊？

135
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:46,320
No, I was gonna tell you this over dinner,
不 我本來想在晚餐時告訴你這個

136
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:48,640
but I met somebody else on my trip.
但我在旅途中遇到了其他人。

137
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:49,700
Oh?
哦？

138
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,960
Her name's Anne. She's a journalist.
她的名字叫安妮。她是一名記者。

139
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,400
We met on the plane.
我們是在飛機上認識的。

140
00:06:53,700 --> 00:06:55,220
She asked me if she could finish off my peanuts.
她問我是否可以吃完我的花生。

141
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:57,320
I thought she said something else. We had a big laugh.
我以為她還說了別的事。我們哈哈大笑。

142
00:07:01,140 --> 00:07:03,340
Yeah, I just, I mean, I got tired of waiting.
是的，我只是，我的意思是，我厭倦了等待。

143
00:07:03,620 --> 00:07:04,640
Well, that's great.
嗯，那太好了。

144
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:08,580
I mean, I'm sorry, but I'm so happy for you.
我的意思是，我很抱歉，但我為你感到高興。

145
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,560
And now I can work for you.
現在我可以為你工作了。

146
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,480
I guess you can.
我想你可以。

147
00:07:11,820 --> 00:07:12,600
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

148
00:07:12,940 --> 00:07:14,280
Oh, this is incredible.
哦，這太不可思議了。

149
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:15,440
Oh.
哦。

150
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,260
All right, you know what?
好吧，你知道嗎？

151
00:07:17,460 --> 00:07:19,800
I'm just gonna roll right in that office and quit.
我要直接滾進那間辦公室然後辭職。

152
00:07:20,380 --> 00:07:20,960
All right.
好的。

153
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:21,260
Okay.
好的。

154
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:23,320
Could you give me a little push?
你能給我一點動力嗎？

155
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:23,720
Yeah, sure.
是的，當然。

156
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,560
Good luck.
祝你好運。

157
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:26,860
I'm quitting. Woo-hoo!
我要辭職了嗚呼！

158
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,880
I'm okay. I'm all right.
我沒事。我沒事。

159
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,580
Wow, that's exciting.
哇，太令人興奮了。

160
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:40,500
You went to Japan, made up a woman.
你去了日本，扮成了女人。

161
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:42,080
What?
什麼？

162
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:46,100
I'm just saying, this woman, I mean, she's fictitious, no?
我只是說，這個女人，我的意思是，她是虛構的，不是嗎？

163
00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:48,860
And why would you say that?
為什麼你會這麼說？

164
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,300
Because you're still into Monica.
因為你仍然喜歡莫妮卡。

165
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,000
So you told her there was somebody else,
所以你告訴她還有其他人

166
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,420
so she would agree to work with you,
這樣她就會同意和你一起工作，

167
