Okay, I love you, is that so bad?
好吧，我愛你，有那麼糟嗎？

462
00:19:26,820 --> 00:19:27,900
No, it's not bad.
不，這還不錯。

463
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:29,140
It's not bad at all.
這一點也不壞。

464
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:31,020
It's really nice.
真的很好。

465
