Look, the only one who stands to get hurt is me,
瞧，唯一會受傷的就是我，

466
00:19:33,740 --> 00:19:34,800
and I'm okay with that.
我對此表示同意。

467
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:38,280
You may be okay with getting hurt,
你可能會接受受傷，

468
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:40,540
but I am not okay with being the one who hurts you.
但我不願意成為傷害你的人。

469
