Shut up for a second and let me just see something.
閉嘴一會兒，讓我看點東西。

478
00:20:15,220 --> 00:20:22,560
Oh, wow.
哦，哇。

479
00:20:28,620 --> 00:20:29,580
Thank you.
謝謝。

480
00:20:29,580 --> 00:20:29,860
Thank you.
謝謝。

481
